another variable refers to it: X_FREE
no other pointer: freed, p is NIL
a list node refers to it: X_FREE
while a procedure holds a copy: X_FREE
after that procedure returned: freed, p is NIL
a procedure holding a copy ended by X_RANGE
after it ended by an exception: freed, p is NIL
a message in a mailbox refers to it: X_FREE
a waiting task holds it as a parameter: X_FREE
after that task ended: freed, p is NIL
